<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2lɔ</book>
  <para style="h">Timote Filana Suran</para>
  <para style="toc3">2TI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Timote Filana</para>
  <para style="toc2">2TI</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kitabu Filana Timote Ma</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔli Alla la Kuma Kitabu Filana Timote Ma</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu filana mɛn sɛbɛra Timote ma, wo sɛbɛra Romi so le rɔ (suran 1 kuma diya 17). Pɔli mirani le ka bila kaso la ɲa gbɛlɛn (suran 2 kuma diya 9) a tora a danna (suran 4 kuma diya 10 a ni 16), a ka kawandi kuma ɲinilu sɛbɛ a kɔfɛbilailu bɛrɛ ma kaninteya rɔ (suran 1 kuma diya 2).</para>
  <para style="ip">Keladen na kuma damirala Alla tandoli le ma ka bɛn Timote la kaninteya ni a lemɛniya ma. Hani tɔrɔ ba ni sɔsɔli ye kun lɔni Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase mɔɔilu ma, a ka Timote jamari ko a ye a fanka don, ka kɛlɛ kɛ wakali rɔ «ikomin Alla la Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin kɛlɛkɛden telenni» (suran 1 kuma diya 3 haan suran 2 kuma diya 13). A ka a lalɔn ko a ye a kɛ a hankili ma mɔɔilu la ko rɔ mɛnilu ye kuma fuuilu lɔla ka a kɛ sɔsɔli ri a ni sɔnkɔ sɔnkɔ mɛnilu tɔnɔ tɛ la, mɛnilu lemɛniya mataa mɔɔilu ma. A ka a fɔ a yɛ, ko a ye to ikomin ale jɛrɛ, a tora telen dɔ ikomin Kitabu ka a fɔ ɲa mɛn ma, Timote mɛn karanni tɛrɛ kɛbi a kanberen mɛsɛn waati la (suran 2 kuma diya 14 haan suran 4 kuma diya 5). A ka a sɛbɛ laban di, talibidenba ka a jɛrɛ mantɔrɔilu la ko fɔ, ka Alla tando mɛn ka a dɛmɛn (suran 4 kuma diya 6 haan 22).</para>
  <para style="ip">Talibidenba Pɔli sɛɛ don de Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase diya haan a siimaya laban (suran 4 kuma diya 7). Kitabu karanna mɔɔilu fanan ka kan le, ka wo sɛɛ don, lemɛniya ni diɲɛ ni kaninteya ni fanka don, hali ii tɛ silan Setana ɲɛrɔ.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Nde Pɔli, mɛn kɛni Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na talibidenba ri Alla sawo rɔ kosa Alla ka an lahidi nii lakisi mɛn na Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ, n ye wo lase, nde le ka ɲin sɛbɛ, <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />ka a lawa n diyanan dencɛ Timote ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">An fa Alla ni an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye hina ni kininkinin ni jususuma di i ma.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baraka bela ni kawandili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />N ye baarala Alla mɛn ye jusu lagbɛ rɔ ikomin n benbailu ka a kɛ ɲa mɛn ma, n ye baraka bilala wo yɛ, n wa kɛ a matarala i yɛ su ni tele waati bɛɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Ka a masɔrɔn, n wa n miri i la kasi ma, a lɔɔ ri n mira n ye i yen kosa n ye fa sɛwa la.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.4</char> Timɔte <char style="fk">kasira</char> le Pɔli bɔra Efɛsi so kɔndɔ waati mɛn na. A ragbɛ Timɔte Fɔlɔ suran 1 kuma diya 3 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />N hankili ye i la lemɛniya bɛrɛ fanan na, mɛn tɛrɛ i ma muso Liwisi ni i na Ewunise rɔ. N lani a la, ko a ye i fanan dɔ. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Wo le rɔ, n ye a labilala i la, Alla ka sɔlifen mɛn di i ma, i ye wo labaara i sɛbɛ la, i ka mɛn sɔrɔn n ka n bolo la i kun ma waati mɛn na Alla matara rɔ. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Ka a masɔrɔn Alla ma nii masumanin di an ma kɔni a la Nii Sɛniman mɛn ye fanka ni kaninteya ni jo ɲuma dila an ma.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Nba, i kana maloya sereya bɔla an Maari yɛ, wala i ye maloya nde la ko rɔ hali n ye kaso la a la ko rɔ. Kɔni an fila ye sɔn tɔrɔya ma an ɲɔɔn fɛ ka bɛn Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma la ko ma Alla fanka baraka rɔ. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Ale mɛn ka an nakisi, ka an kili ko an ye sɛninya. An kɛwaliilu la ko tɛ de, kɔni a jɛrɛ la ko latɛɛnin, a ni a la hina, a ka mɛn di an ma Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ sani waati ye damira. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Kɔni sisɛn a ra lɛnkɛnɛmaya an yɛ an nakisila Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin bɔ rɔ kɛnɛma, mɛn ka saya fanka nɔ, ka nii lakisi ni sayabaliya yiraka Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma fɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Alla ra n kɛ kawandi bɔla ni talibidenba ni karanmɔɔ ri Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma la ko rɔ. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Wo le rɔ, n ye tɔrɔla ko ɲinilu rɔ, kɔni n maloyani tɛ, ka a masɔrɔn n lemɛniyani mɛn ma, n ka wo lɔn. N jusu latɛɛni, a ri se n ta lamarala haan wo lon. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />I ka karan bɛrɛ mɛnilu lamɛn n na, woilu lamara misali ri kaninteya ni lemɛniya fɛ Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa rɔ. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Fen ɲuma mɛn karifani i la, wo lamara Alla la Nii Sɛniman fanka baraka rɔ mɛn ye an dɔ.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />I ka a lɔn ko mɛnilu bɛɛ ye Asi jamana rɔ, woilu ra n nabila, hali Fikelo ni Heremoyene. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Alla ye kininkinin Onesiforo la denbaya ma ka a masɔrɔn a ka n masabali siɲa siyaman. A ma maloya n na ko rɔ hali n tɛrɛ kaso la. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />A sera Romu so kɔndɔ waati mɛn na, a ka a tunadiya n ɲinin ma haan a ka n yen. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Alla ye kininkinin a ma wo Lon. A ka ko mɛnilu kɛ n yɛ Ɛfɛsi so kɔndɔ, i ka woilu lɔn fewu!<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Isa la baaraden ɲumailu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Nba, ile n den, i fanka don wo hina rɔ mɛn ye Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />I ka ko mɛnilu lamɛn, n ka mɛnilu lase sereya siyaman ɲakɔrɔ, woilu karifa landaya mɔɔilu la, mɛnilu fanan di se mɔɔ gbɛrɛilu karanna.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />An ye tɔrɔ an ɲɔɔn fɛ baa an kɛnin de ikomin Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na tɛsidi ɲumailu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Mɔɔ mɛn ye tɛsidi baarala, wo tɛ basan dunuɲa ko gbɛrɛ la ni a ye a fɛ ka a la kuntii hɛnɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Mɔɔ mɛn fanan ye a borila karan dɔ, na wo ma a raja a bori diya bori sariya rɔ, a ti se nɔli kɛla muumɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Sɛnɛkɛla mɛn ye baara gbɛlɛn kɛla, wo fɔlɔ ka kan ka a la sɛnɛ rɔ fen sɔrɔn. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />N ye mɛn fɔla i yɛ, i miri i jusu rɔ wo ma, ka a masɔrɔn Maari ri famunyali di i ma woilu bɛɛ rɔ.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />I hankili to Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ko mɛn wulira saya rɔ, mɛn bɔni Dawuda bɔnsɔn dɔ, ikomin n ye a lasela ɲa mɛn ma Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma rɔ, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />n ye tɔrɔla mɛn na ko rɔ haan ka n sidi ikomin kojuu kɛla. Kɔni Alla la kuma tɛ sidi fewu. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Wo le rɔ, n muɲunni ko bɛɛ kɔrɔ jama suwandinin na ko rɔ, kosa ii fanan ye kisi sɔrɔn mɛn ye Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ, ka ii to habadan gbiliya rɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Tuɲa le kuma ɲin di:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">Ni an ni ale ra faa an ɲɔɔn fɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">an di to a fɛ.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Ni an ka an wakali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">an ni ale ri to mansaya la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">Ni an ka an ban a rɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">a fanan di a ban an dɔ.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Ni an ma telen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">ale ri telen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">ka a masɔrɔn a ti se a banna a jɛrɛ rɔ.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Wo koilu labila mɔɔilu la, ka ii jamari Alla ɲakɔrɔ, ko masɔsɔ la ko rɔ ka bɛn kuma kɔrɔilu ma, ko masɔsɔ mɛnilu tɔnɔ si tɛ ye. A ye ii lamɛn mɔɔilu le halakila dɔrɔn! <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />I lakaran, ka i jɛrɛ yiraka Alla la ikomin baaraden bɛrɛ, mɛn baara nɔilu mamaloyanin tɛ, mɛn ye Alla la tuɲa karan kɛla a ɲa ma. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Sɛ kuma rakolon kɔfɛ, ka a masɔrɔn mɛnilu ye woilu fɔla, woilu ye tola ii mataala Alla lɔn na le dɔrɔn. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Ii la karan kɛnin de ikomin jankarɔ mɛn da ye warala fari ma. Humeneyo ni Fileto ye wo mɔɔilu le tɛma, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />mɛnilu ra ii mataa tuɲa la. Ii ye a fɔla, ko mɔɔilu ye lawulila saya rɔ waati mɛn na, wo ra tamin, ka mɔɔ doilu la lemɛniya tiɲan. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Kɔni, Alla la bon ju siini jusii bɛrɛ mɛn kan, wo siini gben, kuma ɲinilu kɛrɛndɛnni a kan ko, «Maari ta ye mɔɔ mɛnilu ri, a ka woilu lɔn. Ni mɔɔ si ye Maari tɔɔ fɔla, wo ka kan ka a kɔnkɔ don telenbaliya la.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.19</char> Jateilu suran 16 kuma diya 5</note><verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Baarafen su siyaman de bon ba kɔndɔ, wodigbɛ ni sanin dɔrɔn tɛ, kɔni jiri ni banku janinnin fanan ye ye. Doilu ye labaarala gbiliya koilu rɔ, doilu ye labaarala gbiliyabaliya koilu rɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Ni mɔɔ si ka a jɛrɛ lasɛninya wo gbiliyabaliya koilu ma, a ye kɛla le ikomin baarafen gbiliyanin, baa a ra kɛ mɔɔ sɛniman di, a ri se baarala a tii yɛ, a rabɛnni baara ɲuma bɛɛ kɛ kanma. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />I bori foninkeya waati kunfan koilu ma, ka bila telenbaya ni lemɛniya ni kaninteya ni jususuma, i ni mɛnilu ye Maari batola jusu gbɛya la ai ɲɔɔn fɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />I ban hankilidɔɔya ni kɔmɔɔya ko masɔsɔliilu ma, i ye a lɔn ko woilu ye nala kɛlɛ le ri. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Adon, Maari la baaraden ma kan ka kɛlɛ kɛ; kɔni a ka kan ka ɲumaya bɛɛ la, ka kɛ karan kɛla ɲuma ni mɔɔ diɲani ri. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />A ka kan ka ko masɔsɔlailu latelen nɔya rɔ kosa Alla ye a kɛ ii ye tubi, ka tuɲa lɔn, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />ka hankili sɔrɔn, ka ii jɛrɛ bɔ Ibulusa la julu lasiini na, ii mirani mɛnilu la kosa ii ye to a sawo rɔ.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Dunuɲa laban na ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />A lɔn ko waati labanilu ri gbɛlɛnya. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Mɔɔilu ri kɛ ɲangboilu ni wodi kɔmɛilu ni jɛrɛdabailu ni wasolailu ni nanikɛlailu ri, ka murunti ii sɔrɔnbailu ma, ka kɛ waliɲuma lɔnbaliilu ni sɛninyabaliilu ri, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />a ni hinabaliilu ni kininkininbaliilu ni mɔɔ tɔɔ tiɲanilu ni jɛrɛ mirabaliilu ni mɔɔ ɲarajaniilu ni koɲuma kɛla juuilu <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />a ni kunfantoilu ni kondonjuuilu ni lanjɛrɛlailu, mɛnilu diyanan koilu duman ii yɛ ka tamin Alla la. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Ii ka ii jɛrɛ kɛ Alla lɔnnailu ri, kɔni ii ri ii ban a fanka rɔ. I mabɔ wo mɔɔilu la. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Doilu ye ai tɛma, woilu ri ii jɛrɛ ladon bonilu kɔndɔ mɔɔ lakunfan ko rɔ, ii ri musoilu masɔrɔn mɛnilu hankili ma bon, julumun donin gbilin ye mɛnilu kun ma, mɛnilu masɔmɔnnin kunfan su bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Wo musoilu ye karanna waati bɛɛ, kɔni ii tɛ tuɲa lɔnna muumɛ! <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Wo cɛɛilu kɛnin de ikomin Jannɛsi ni Janbɛrɛsi mɛnilu ka Musa masɔsɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.8</char> Judiyailu la namunilu karan dɔ, woyimɛ mɛnilu ka Musa masɔsɔ Misiran jamana rɔ, woilu tɔɔ le tɛrɛ wo ɲa le ma. A ragbɛ Hɔrɔya suran 7 kuma diya 11 ni suran 7 kuma diya 22 kɔndɔ.</note> Cɛɛ ɲinilu fanan ye tuɲa masɔsɔla wo ɲa le ma. Ii hankili ɲakɛnin, ii la lemɛniya ra kɛ bɔnɔ ri. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Kɔni woilu tɛ nala wala ɲɛfɛ fewu ka a masɔrɔn mɔɔ bɛɛ ka ii la hankilidɔɔya lɔn, ikomin Jannɛsi ni Janbɛrɛsi kɛra ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kawandili tɔilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Kɔni ile ra n na karan lɔn, a ni n tamanɲa ni n wɔnike ni n na lemɛniya ni n na diɲɛ ni n na kaninteya ni n na tunadiya <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />a ni n na bɛsɛnkɔniya ni n na tɔrɔya. Tɔrɔya su ɲuman ye ye, n ma mɛn yen Antiyɔki ni Ikoniyɔmu ni Lisitiri soilu rɔ? Bɛsɛnkɔniya su ɲuman ye ye n ma mɛn yen? Kɔni Maari ka n kunka woilu bɛɛ ma. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Mɛnilu bɛɛ ye a fɛ, ii ye taama Alla la lɔnnin dɔ Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ, woilu ri bɛnsɛnkɔlɔya. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Kɔni mɔɔ juuilu ni mɛnilu ye ii jɛrɛ kɛla dina mɔɔilu ri, woilu ye janfala juuya le rɔ dɔrɔn, ka doilu majuuwaya, ii fanan di majuuwaya. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Kɔni ile, i karan ko mɛn ma, i lemɛniyani mɛn ma fewu, to wo rɔ ka a masɔrɔn i ka i karanmɔɔilu lɔn. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Kɛbi i denmɛsɛnya waati la, i ka Kitabu Sɛniman yɔrɔ sɛbɛniilu lɔn mɛn di se hankili dila i ma ka bɛn kisi la ko ma lemɛniya fɛ Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Ka a masɔrɔn Kitabu sɛbɛli bɛɛ farani Alla le la. A bɛnnin karan kɛ fen ni fili jabi fen ni ko matelen fen ni mɔɔ kolo fen di telen dɔ, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />kosa Alla la mɔɔ ye dafa, baarafen ye to a bolo baara ɲuma bɛɛ kɛ kanma.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />N ye i jamarila Alla ɲakɔrɔ a ni Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin, mɛn di mɔɔ faaniilu ni mɔɔ niilamailu bɛɛ makiti, mɛn ye makɛnɛyala Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko rɔ a ni a la mansaya. <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Alla la kuma la ko kawandili bɔ, ni a fɔ waati ka ɲin, ni a ma ɲin, i rabɛn. I ye mɔɔilu sɔn fɔ, ka jaman ii ma, ka ii lalemɛniya, ka ii karan diɲɛ bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Baa waati natɔ, mɔɔilu tɛ nala sɔnna karan bɛrɛ ma. Ii bilatɔ ii jɛrɛ diyanan koilu le kɔfɛ, ka to karanmɔɔilu ladɛnna ii jɛrɛ yɛ, mɛnilu ye ii karanna ii tolo diyanan koilu ma. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Ii ri ii tolo bɔ tuɲa kumailu la, ka ii tolo malɔ taliilu la. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Kɔni ile, i ye i jɛrɛ mira ko bɛɛ rɔ, ka i tunadiya tɔrɔyailu kɔrɔ, ka Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase, i ye i la baara bɛɛ lakanbali.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Ka a masɔrɔn, nde ra kɛ ikomin minninfen saraka labɔnni, n wa waati ra madon. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />N da kɛlɛ ɲuma kɛ, ka se n na bori dan na, ka to lemɛniya rɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Sisɛn, n di telenbaya fanka sɔrɔn kɔndɔn sɔrɔn Maari ka mɛn namara n yɛ, a ye mɛn dila n ma wo lon, ale mɛn kɛni kiti tɛɛla telennin di. Nde kelen tɛ kɔni a na ko lɔɔ ye mɛnilu bɛɛ la.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Karan, i ye na n tɔrɔfɛ jonna! <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Baa dunuɲa ɲin duman Demasi yɛ, a ra n nabila ka wa Tesaloniki so kɔndɔ. Kiresen da wa Kalati mara rɔ. Tite da wa Dalamatiya mara rɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luka le kelen ye n tɔrɔfɛ sinɛn I ni Marika bɛɛ ye na ka a masɔrɔn a ri se n dɛmɛnna baara diya. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />N da Tisiki lawa Ɛfɛsi so kɔndɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />I wa kɛ nala waati mɛn na, n da n na durukiba ni n na kitabuilu to Karapo wara Torohasi so kɔndɔ, i ye na ii ri n yɛ, a gbengben mɛnilu sɛbɛnin gboloilu kan.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Siyaki Alɛsandiri ra kojuu kɛ n na haan! Maari ri a sara a baara la. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />I fanan ye a la ko kɛ i hankili la, ka a masɔrɔn a ka an na kumailu masɔsɔ le a juuman na!<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />N ka n jɛrɛ kun mafɔ fɔlɔ mɛn kɛra kitila diya, mɔɔ si ma n dɛmɛn, bɛɛ ka n nabila. Alla kana ii mira wo la. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Kɔni Maari le ka n dɛmɛn, ka n fanka don kosa n ye kawandili dafanin bɔ, siyailu bɛɛ ye a lamɛn. A ka n kunka yarailu da ma fanan. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Maari ri n kunka kojuu baarailu bɛɛ ma, ka n nakisi kosa n ye don a la mansaya rɔ harijeene. Gbiliya ye di ale ma habadan haan habadan, amina.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuwali tɔilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />N ye Pirisili ni Akila tuwala a ni Onesiforo la denbaya. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Eratusi ra to Korɛnti so kɔndɔ, n da Torofime jankarɔnin fanan to Milɛti so kɔndɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Karan, i ye na sani nɛnɛ waati ye se.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Ewubulo ye i tuwala, a ni Pudɛn ni Linosi ni Kelodiya a ni an badenmailu bɛɛ.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Maari ye to i nii rɔ. Alla ye hina ai la.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>